# Wave W17-Z (Route 217): white sand — the lakeside path’s packed sand-snow, design-authorised: a warm-tinted packed sand running the bench from the bridge’s end to Lake Insight’s shore, the one warm note in the snow country (design: the long road’s tread, packed by climbers and wardens). Split from Lake Insight’s shore sand ahead by warmth entire (bench sand vs lake sand-snow) and from Route 216’s stone paving behind it by material: this path is packed, that one is laid.
